From cb6359e53d539a59c8f054653a9fa1646916e964 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Justin <justurn@live.com>
Date: Mon, 12 Oct 2026 19:34:59 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] feat: warlock imp, rogue Evasion, rest at 80 %, ranged pack
 check (F-219)

- combat: track our pet from SMSG_PET_SPELLS (CombatState.pet) and send it
  at the kill target (CMSG_PET_ACTION ACT_COMMAND|COMMAND_ATTACK) - a
  defensive pet never answers what WE attack
- runner: a warlock summons its imp (688) out of combat when it has none;
  it never had, and tanked every mob in cloth
- rogue: Evasion at 2+ attackers or below 50 % (in the spellbook, never cast)
- rest before moving on below 80 % (was 70): most deaths were the next mob
  arriving while still low (rogue: 23 of 33 defend deaths)
- kill(): ranged pulls of a target with 3+ hostiles in reach are parked too
  (a mage's Frostbolt into Night Web's Hollow drew six spiders)

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_019SSuH6gpqY4Kn5Rk9sd149
